---
title: Unstructured Prompt vs Flowchart-Based Prompt
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph bad["❌ Unstructured prompt"]
        direction TB
        x1["'Please write Python<br/>to check student scores'"] --> x2["🤖 AI must infer intent"]
        x2 --> x3["Result: 200 lines of code<br/>contains unrequested features<br/>diverges from objective"]
    end

    subgraph good["✅ Prompt with flowchart"]
        direction TB
        y1["'Here is my flowchart:'<br/>[paste mermaid]"] --> y2["🤖 AI understands clearly"]
        y2 --> y3["Result: 20 lines of code<br/>follows every flowchart step<br/>immediately usable"]
    end

    classDef badStyle fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#ef4444,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef goodStyle fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#10b981,color:#064e3b
    class x1,x2,x3 badStyle
    class y1,y2,y3 goodStyle
